[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3648934556","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113873#issuecomment-3648934556","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113873","id":3648934556,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZflKc","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T05:04:47Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T11:34:20Z","body":"> so until the SDL version is updated serial numbers cannot be read on Linux.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I don't think that fix will be included in SDL 3.2.X versions since the PR for it doesn't have any milestones assigned and SDL 3.2.28 (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113968) doesn't include it either :(\r\nSo that fix will most likely have to be included in this PR, and a patch will have to be made (see the `thirdparty/sdl/patches` folder, the patches can be made via the `git diff thirdparty/sdl/` command)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3648934556/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"la